# Source is LF in the repo AND in the working tree, on every OS — pins the checkout so a Windows
# clone with core.autocrlf=true can't flip it to CRLF (which shows up as a whole-file diff).
# Unrelated to the EXPORT: the .CivBeyondSwordWBSave the app writes is CRLF by design (Civ4's
# parser is Windows-native and CTDs on LF-only saves) — that's runtime output, never a tracked file.
* text=auto eol=lf
# TypeScript is the source of truth. The JavaScript beside each .ts / .mts is emitted in place by tsc
# (npm run build) and committed, because the app is served as-is with no build step (TerraForm.exe,
# serve.py, the MCP entry point mcp/server.mjs). Mark it generated so GitHub collapses it in diffs and
# leaves it out of the language stats. Edit the .ts, never the .js.
core/*.js           linguist-generated
games/*/*.js        linguist-generated
mcp/*.mjs           linguist-generated
